    "concept_2": {
      "id": "concept_2",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Not every root sign gives a surd.\n\n√9 = 3, which is rational. So √9 is not an irrational surd after simplification.\n\n√7 cannot be simplified to a rational number, so it is a surd.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
